{"suite": "fixture", "fixture": true, "description": "Synthetic c3_shell outputs: minified bundles, buried test failures, compiler error walls, progress bars, JSONL, binary, ANSI, huge stderr, timeouts. Every case is a seeded generator in tests/shell_eval/generators.py; checks name the fragments the agent must still be able to read.", "default_max_bytes": 18432}
